# el, not gr: po/documentation.po4a.cfg declares Greek as `el`, its ISO 639-1 language code, and po4a
# names the output directory after the language. `gr` is Greece's country code and matches nothing po4a
# writes, so a Greek render left its directory untracked.
el/
